<title>MEXICO: ICA wins Malaysia dam project.</title>
<headline>ICA wins Malaysia dam project.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican construction firm Empresas ICA said on Thursday it won a joint project to construct a hydroelectric dam in Malaysia.</p>
<p>ICA has 25 percent of the project, which is estimated will be worth $900 million and will take six years to build, it said.</p>
</text>
